WEBVTT

00:11:58.284 --> 00:12:00.061
Not a day goes by

00:12:00.085 --> 00:12:04.521
that we are not made aware
of the struggle that continues.

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:11.497
I believe that dance
can elevate our human experience

00:12:11.521 --> 00:12:13.418
beyond words.

00:12:13.442 --> 00:12:16.664
And when you're sitting in the dark,

00:12:16.688 --> 00:12:18.710
in the theater,

00:12:18.734 --> 00:12:22.601
having a personal experience,

00:12:22.625 --> 00:12:26.510
you don't feel blocked or misunderstood.

00:12:27.157 --> 00:12:29.069
You feel open,